            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThis seems to be Neovim 0.11 issue which is fixed on Neovim 0.12 (current Nightly, hopefully-soon-to-be released stable version). It also works as expected on Neovim 0.10.\n\nI believe fixing this only for Neovim 0.11 when the next version would not require the fix is a bit redundant. Thanks for reporting this, though!",
